The redesigned anatomy system must become reusable across the entire fitness workspace.

Every exercise and educational video should use the same underlying anatomical conventions.

A new exercise should not require manually inventing another set of external muscle objects.

The system should understand the difference between displaying the character, highlighting an active muscle and exposing underlying anatomy.

Explore the most suitable asset structure, rendering architecture, rigging strategy and authoring workflow.

You own the implementation decisions.

**The desired result is one coherent, believable 3D anatomical character with multiple visualization capabilities, not a mannequin with a collection of floating muscles attached to it.**

This requirement is fundamental to the future quality and identity of the fitness brand.



